Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是去拿吃的 你这个疯女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was reaching for the food, you mad cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃提斯是我们一边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attius stands with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他替该死的罗马人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stands a fucking Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏不让我刮脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus denies me sharpened blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personal matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.01,0:00:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,西利西亚的强盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brigands of Cilicia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pirates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,市政官跟我有个协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Aedile and I had an arrangement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不愿意求饶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not beg for my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.83,0:00:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到印章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do this thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will be released.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,决斗的那人…跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your man make fight gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌尔比安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ulpianus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who you speak of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的人准备进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your men to advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.95,0:00:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲明确下令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father gave strict order not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.69,0:00:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲要的是能打仗的狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father desires a wolf of battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.87,0:00:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.77,0:00:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,都别动 都他妈的给老子坚守阵地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand ground, stand your fucking ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.35,0:00:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:01:00.89,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：诅咒者之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.49,0:01:04.11,Title,0,0,0,0,,《十一抽杀》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.06,0:01:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前我们还有事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}There stands greater worry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,比西利西亚人带进港的粮食更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}than grain carried to port by Cilician shits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有粮食我们吃什么 拿空口承诺当饭吃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you have us feast upon? Promise of better days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.64,0:01:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望吃罗马人的肉喝罗马人的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see bellies filled with the death of Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.32,0:01:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏肯定会派更多的军队来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus is certain to dispatch more soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该做好迎敌的准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we should be preparing to greet them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.91,0:01:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.28,0:01:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证我们的人不要饿着肚子上战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}By ensuring our own do not go into battle weakened by hunger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.51,0:01:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,收帆 晚上在这儿过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Furl sails, we here for the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.92,0:01:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heracleo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.11,0:01:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,此行收获如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How fares recent venture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是口渴 那就天随人愿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are of a thirst, the gods have shown favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.20,0:01:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没带粮食来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You carry no grain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从罗马人的船上抢来了一堆罐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A clutch of amphoras so filled were liberated from Roman ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.09,0:01:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是船长装的酒比粮食多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet its captain held more stock in drink than seed of bread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.01,0:01:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能拿酒充饥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wine will not feed my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.31,0:01:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为防天寒 罗马人把大多收成\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Romans have stored most of their harvest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:01:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,都放进粮仓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}against encroaching chill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.57,0:02:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,抢粮的难度自然就增加了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Difficulty rises in securing such bounty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以价钱也要涨\N{\fnArial\fs30}As does its price?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.55,0:02:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 不要冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, hold and fall to reason!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,每人拿一把粮食 让他们离开码头\N{\fnArial\fs30}See each to a handful, and clear them from the docks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.91,0:02:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不少奴隶正徒步接近城门\N{\fnArial\fs30}More slaves taken afoot approach gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给他们也一人分一把粮食吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you see them to a handful as well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过我妹妹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know of my sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,城池沦陷后我就再没见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't laid eyes since the city fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能把仅有的粮食浪费在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should not be wasting what little food we have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.62,0:02:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死的罗马人身上 - 你知道我意已决\N{\fnArial\fs30}- on fucking Romans. - You know my mind upon subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟克雷斯看法一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand with Crixus towards it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应莱塔的 就决不会反悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have given Laeta my word. It will not be broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.59,0:03:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,进城前必须先交出武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hold weapon you must give over before entering city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merci.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经也像他一样 好像是上辈子的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems a lifetime past, that I stood as him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮出烙印 看看你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show brand, and see what you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮出你的烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show brand or mark, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明你是奴隶 不是共和国的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to prove you stand former slave and no friend of the Republic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无处可去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have nowhere to go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.89,0:03:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你的烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me your brand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最厉害的武器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most fearsome weapons yet exposed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再仔细点搜查我也没意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would take no offense to closer inspection…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开包裹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open bag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put mind at ease, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里用不着钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have no need of this here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯不喜欢随身带钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus does not favor his people holding coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她有克拉苏军队的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one carries knowledge of Crassus' army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我们码头大概半天的路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say about a half day's march from our wharves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How great a force?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.67,0:04:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,据她说营地比城还大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larger than fucking city by her word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他依然扎营不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet he has made camp and holds advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.39,0:04:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真有那么多人 为什么要等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why stay hand when it grips such numbers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他早该提着老屌上来了 如果他认为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He but grips his own fucking cock if he believes we will…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死的罗马人 - 罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fucking Romans! - The Romans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭城门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快他妈让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give fucking way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要求亮出烙印的时候 那些人就动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking shits drew upon us when pressed to show brand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉你的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no greater glory…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.59,0:05:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我最大的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the death of your enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.69,0:05:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 让我看看你的烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would lay eyes upon your brand friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.95,0:05:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可有点麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that presents some difficulties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是没有 你麻烦更大\N{\fnArial\fs30}More so if you are absent one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我主人把烙印都刺在私处旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dominus branded all his slaves close to cock and cunt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.36,0:05:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喝醉时不分男女地通吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}equally enjoyed upon drunken nights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.83,0:05:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就用那把刀砍了他 割掉了烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}With that knife I rid myself of him and his fucking mark…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣服穿好 跟他们去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall to cover and join the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,头砍下来 挂在城墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sever their heads and set them to pike upon wall, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告还有企图的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}as warning against future attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯 甘尼克斯 艾力冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus, Gannicus, Agron…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.97,0:06:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有重要的事跟你们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have much needed words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.74,0:06:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你伤这么重 我心里不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seizes heart, to know you in such pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不见的地方伤得更重\N{\fnArial\fs30}A deeper wound stands removed from sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.01,0:06:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没来看你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has not come to your side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我送来营地时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recall my father's grim visage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我依稀看见了父亲的严峻表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}when first you delivered me to encampment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.49,0:06:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后再也没见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not since laid eyes upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别为这事担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place no worries in the absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,统帅现在满脑子都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Imperator's mind is taken with thoughts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么剿灭斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}of coming battle against Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:07:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要夺回那座城吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We move to reclaim the city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有接到拔营的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have received no order to break encampment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.41,0:07:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过派了一大队人马去北边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though a large number of men have been dispatched north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,北边\N{\fnArial\fs30}North?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,去干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种大事你父亲才不会告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not hold your father's confidence in such matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stand as one in such regard.{\r}
