Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,更有价值的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}far more estimable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.44,0:15:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不愿住在宅子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She turns from offer of villa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,反倒要睡在稻草马粪旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}for straw and the smell of shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.24,0:15:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不理解的人 她自然不想解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}For reason fallen upon understanding ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.78,0:15:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人的心思\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mind of a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是猜不透\N{\fnArial\fs30}A foreign thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.49,0:15:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我跟她单独谈谈 好问个明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have words alone, and see it deciphered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.34,0:15:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}She holds no threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在门口等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall place myself at entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,手里拿着剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}With sword clutched in fucking hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到屠影之英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did not think the Slayer of the Shadow of Death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也需要保镖\N{\fnArial\fs30}had need of protector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上出了事 只好如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunate precaution, in wake of morning's events.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说了有人打进城内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word carries of the attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有听说马科斯•克拉苏的消息呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it also carry word of Marcus Crassus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.31,0:15:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次行动就是他安排的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the man who commanded it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.78,0:15:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很高兴嘛 知道罗马派这人来杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are pleased with the man Rome has sent to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏办事的决绝无出其右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus stands as no other in certainty of intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.81,0:15:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不死 他不会罢休\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will not stop short of your end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not the first Roman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.69,0:15:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信自己能办到这件事的罗马人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to believe himself capable of the act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.65,0:15:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他之前的人没有哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those that came before him did not hold wealth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有能让女神都嫉妒的财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}to turn Juno Moneta envious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,金钱在战场上没有多少价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coin holds little worth upon the field of battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么聚敛财富的决心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of a mind keen enough to amass it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.83,0:16:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们第一次见面时你谈到了与克拉苏的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upon our first meeting you spoke of dealings with Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你把一切经过都告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would know of anything ear may have caught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.05,0:16:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事既不能倒转乾坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such knowledge will not reverse sun, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能改变河流的走向\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor alter the course of river's fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就没什么不能说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there stands no reason to deny request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们与克拉苏的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our business with Crassus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅限于粮食和货运 没有别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}concerned only grain and shipment, nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我夫君讲了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet my husband imparted story, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那不勒斯的市政官告诉他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}shared by Aedile of Neapolis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒他不要重蹈覆辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}towards future dealings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人与克拉苏做了很多交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man was thick in negotiations with Crassus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.71,0:16:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他截到竞争对手所写的信件\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he intercepted message from reviled competitor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.84,0:16:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现对手给克拉苏的条件更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}offering more favorable terms to Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当看到利润\N{\fnArial\fs30}While seeing both profit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,和重要客户就要消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}and valuable client soon to vanish, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:16:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,市政官烧掉了那封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Aedile burned errant message, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:17:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,并很快答应了克拉苏的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}swiftly agreed to Crassus' demands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.55,0:17:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个月后他才发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to discover months later{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是克拉苏亲自寄出的那封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus himself had sent the message, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.00,0:17:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的就是要市政官拿到手\N{\fnArial\fs30}intending for the Aedile to lay hands upon it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,按他的想法行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}and move in direction desired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.11,0:17:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也截到过克拉苏的信件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I too intercepted message from Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.33,0:17:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用搜集到的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}And used what was gleaned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为他铺平了统率大军的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}to clear path for him to assume command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将恐惧深深地印在了共和国的心脏里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have struck fear into the very heart of the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.64,0:17:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,试想那个打败你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine the glory that awaits…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.39,0:17:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,该享有多大的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}the man who defeats you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥运来的比想象中的少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heracleo delivers less than expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.81,0:17:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,口粮必须再折半分配\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rations must be lowered by another half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会坚持下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will make due.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到克拉苏夺回这座城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until Crassus reclaims the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.51,0:17:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,善出奇兵的人可不止他一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does not stand the only one capable of the unexpected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.49,0:17:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找赫拉克里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us seek Heracleo, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.51,0:17:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让全知全能的克拉苏大吃一惊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a future even the mighty Crassus will not see coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.49,0:18:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,再派一千人去援助昆提尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dispatch another thousand men to aid Quinctius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须加快速度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must see progress hastened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,代我行使权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}My word and my will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.32,0:18:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白这意味着什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand what that means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.34,0:18:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.73,0:18:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的第一场战斗 以斯巴达克斯的胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first battle in my campaign forever etched in history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.40,0:18:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远载入史册了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a victory for Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.70,0:18:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 父亲 - 在我带主力部队到达之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Father… - He was not to be engaged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要打草惊蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}until I arrived with proper force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我说得不够清楚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was command not fucking clear?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.01,0:19:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当斯巴达克斯出了城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet opportunity presented{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.93,0:19:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是千载难逢的机会呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Spartacus moved beyond city walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.41,0:19:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为不去把握才是大错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it greater offense not to seize moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.25,0:19:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做过这样的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}A decision I made by myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.85,0:19:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was yet a little boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.95,0:19:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉没有遵守您的命令 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies for disobeying your command, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.61,0:19:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还年轻 这事情还可以谅解\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing that could be forgiven in light of youth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的部下私自撤退一事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet your men falling to retreat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.79,0:19:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不能随便放过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}does not so easily slip from concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.22,0:19:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令他们坚守阵地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ordered them to stand ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们还是逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet they fled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们畏惧敌人甚于他们的将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they feared the enemy more than their commanders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.09,0:19:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须纠正这一错误认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}A false assumption we must see corrected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.45,0:19:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,您想让我受到怎样的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}What punishment would you have me inflict?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,以儆效尤\N{\fnArial\fs30}One to stand warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要他们知道承受克拉苏家族的怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}That death at the hands of Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不如死在斯巴达克斯手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}pales against the wrath of the House of Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,十一抽杀律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decimation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从马略时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not since the days of Marius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.10,0:20:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么野蛮的制度就没有实行过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has savage ritual been so commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想杀一儆百\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would make example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.09,0:20:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在敌人面前抱头逃窜有什么结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what befalls a man who turns heel in face of enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.98,0:20:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fault is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.93,0:20:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是听你的命令守住阵地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had I obeyed your order to stand ground…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,军队自乱阵脚 四下奔逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our men broke rank and fled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.73,0:20:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were left absent choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲也不给我选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}As my father now leaves me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.55,0:20:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,五十个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.58,0:20:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,五十颗石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,五颗抹上了死亡的颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five stained with the promise of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.06,0:20:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽得好就能活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draw well and live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.94,0:20:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽得不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draw poorly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.63,0:21:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在别人逃走时 你留在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stayed at my side while the others ran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.23,0:21:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能活着都是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am yet from this world because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.69,0:21:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再想这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place it from mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.84,0:21:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷我抽到好签吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pray I draw well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不值得跟这些懦夫们一道抽签\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not deserve to be placed at risk among cowards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.73,0:21:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会跟我父亲谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will talk to my father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.74,0:21:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,求他把你从十一抽杀律的名单中去掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and beg your removal from decimation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做在他的眼里只会降低你的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}The act would only diminish you in his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.62,0:21:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不允许这种事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing I would never allow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他的军团中最可敬的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand most honorable in his legions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.62,0:21:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎会他妈的落得这般下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is fucking reward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.37,0:21:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要遵命行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall do as commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.22,0:21:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,和所有的士兵一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As all soldiers must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.82,0:22:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿比马厩还臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stables were a sweeter smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.67,0:22:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡斯特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.81,0:22:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Heracleo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.72,0:22:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次看到他时 他正喝酒玩女人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was heavy with drink and whores last I laid eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.61,0:22:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,到他船上的甲板找找吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seek him upon deck of his ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man has a well known preference{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.97,0:22:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙最喜欢在海上干事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for sea and cunt, spread equally before him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.35,0:22:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.48,0:22:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 喝一杯 我们一道去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, share cup, and we shall seek him together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.85,0:22:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不跟你这种贱人一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would not wallow in such low company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.11,0:22:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有要事在身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are moved by pressing business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.23,0:22:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有空再喝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.77,0:22:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想搞那小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wish to fuck the man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:22:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,介绍两句然后掏老二呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}make introduction and present cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.63,0:23:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿吃屎也不找那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would sooner caress shit and call it lover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.57,0:23:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,西利西亚人不能信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cilicians cannot be trusted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.55,0:23:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很了解他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are familiar with their kind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.31,0:23:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前和这种人相处过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had the displeasure of their company, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.84,0:23:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}in years past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.51,0:23:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话要当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choose words with care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.71,0:23:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯当他们是盟友呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus calls them fucking ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.03,0:23:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不同意这说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not share opinion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.36,0:23:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同不同意顶屁用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would hold no fucking matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.06,0:23:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是鞍前马后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am but humble servant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.81,0:23:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为伟大首领卖命的仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the will of our glorious leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.69,0:23:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到传言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard rumor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.76,0:23:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家把斯巴达克斯奉为神明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus stands a god among his people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.20,0:23:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了他的大业 我多少次豁出性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have imperiled life for his cause many times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.05,0:23:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在维苏威和凯洛河\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Vesuvius and Calor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.04,0:23:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多战斗 数不胜数\N{\fnArial\fs30}and battles far too numerous in the counting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.42,0:23:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻占这座城的时候也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even in the taking of this fucking city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.16,0:23:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果眼睁睁看着残存的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to witness remainder of enemy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.48,0:23:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在城里活得好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}spared within its walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.25,0:24:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛苦到手的钱财上缴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And coin honestly gained{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.40,0:24:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去跟该死的西利西亚人\N{\fnArial\fs30}stripped from hand to forge bargain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.19,0:24:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the fucking Cilicians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.74,0:24:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪你要从进城的奴隶那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But small wonder you are forced to relieve{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.24,0:24:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄点小钱 原来是逼不得已\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you can from those newly entering gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.42,0:24:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点钱还远远不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fraction of what is owed to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.96,0:24:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家当都在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is all I carry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.03,0:24:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我们今后的友谊 收下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it yours, toward our continued friendship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.17,0:24:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟友谊这稀罕物比起来也太少了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too small a sum, to purchase so rare an item.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.65,0:24:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定我们能一起挣大钱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps together we can see it grow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.51,0:24:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都能赚足银子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And both our fortunes rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.10,0:25:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.64,0:25:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不准说出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not have you speak of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.61,0:25:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 女主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.20,0:25:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再是女主人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I no longer stand as such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.12,0:25:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以叫我莱塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may call me Laeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.27,0:25:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我常常想成为你们家的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I often dreamed of being of your house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.40,0:25:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是洛厄斯家的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were one of Laurus', were you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.58,0:25:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无数次祈祷能够摆脱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many nights I laid prayers to be free of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.25,0:25:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿城池沦陷不是因为你的祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only city did not need to fall in their answering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.58,0:25:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍惜现在拥有的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embrace what you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.65,0:25:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,世事无常 瞬息万变\N{\fnArial\fs30}All can change in sudden moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.66,0:25:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, you fucking cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.48,0:25:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,布瑞克提斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brictius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.93,0:25:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯明确下过令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus gave clear orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.39,0:25:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准对这些人动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hands are to be laid upon these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.37,0:25:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这罗马混蛋对我动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Roman shit laid hands upon me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.44,0:25:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经过时抓我衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}snapping at robe as I passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.97,0:25:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道我妹妹的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I but entreated for word of my sister…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.90,0:25:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck your sister!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.12,0:25:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢拔出来 不想活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unleash cock, and find it severed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.96,0:26:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的脑袋都应该砍了挂起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All their fucking heads should be set upon pike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.29,0:26:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.35,0:26:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要谢就谢斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owed to Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.49,0:26:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是同意把你脑袋挂起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tend to agree about the pikes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.90,0:26:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.79,0:26:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.86,0:26:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲比娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fabia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.06,0:26:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,头发是亚麻色的 跟你女人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}flaxen of hair, such as your woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.73,0:26:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 告诉我她是否活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg of you, I must know if she lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.57,0:26:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多罗马人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many Roman dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.41,0:26:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再碰我们 就跟你妹妹黄泉相会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You join sister perhaps, touch again one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.35,0:26:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.79,0:26:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not seen her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.14,0:26:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们像妈妈喂奶一样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.35,0:26:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,护着这帮罗马混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.01,0:26:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯为什么放过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why Spartacus allow them live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.35,0:26:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此我无法理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hold no understanding towards it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.03,0:26:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们得尊重他的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet we shall honor desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.36,0:26:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙的头我也想挂起来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.14,0:26:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯 我有话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus, I must have words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.95,0:26:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小丫头不能喝不能操\N{\fnArial\fs30}None give little girl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.45,0:26:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}not drink and fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.95,0:26:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得很对\N{\fnArial\fs30}She makes valid argument.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.51,0:26:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须听一听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.04,0:26:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了一件你们担心的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have laid eyes upon something that lends worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.84,0:28:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这样有好多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have taken to each other's arms many times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.07,0:28:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,却从来没这么爽过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet never have soared so high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.60,0:28:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们远离了罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are far from Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.32,0:28:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就没有了束缚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tethers that prevent such flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.08,0:28:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.02,0:28:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我陪在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}For allowing me to stay by your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.62,0:28:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never have you leave it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.88,0:28:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的存在让我感到特别安心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your presence gives much needed comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.24,0:29:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很费心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must weigh mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.48,0:29:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This war with Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.23,0:29:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是根肉刺 很快就会拔除\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is but nuisance, soon to fade from memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.46,0:29:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忧心的是身边的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My thoughts churn upon closer relation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.58,0:29:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过提比略的伤势已经好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have said Tiberius' wounds already mend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.60,0:29:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来他还是能代你行使权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will stand your word and will in coming days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.05,0:29:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,责任太重 我怀疑他根本背负不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}A weight I question placing again on so green a sapling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.91,0:29:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在父亲如阳光般的指导下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He grows stronger each day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.95,0:29:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他每天都茁壮成长\N{\fnArial\fs30}beneath warming sun of father's guidance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.89,0:29:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,提比略倒是努力想要取悦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Tiberius has given all to please me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.06,0:29:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望建功立业\N{\fnArial\fs30}to become honored soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.61,0:29:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可每当我看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet when eyes are greeted, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.65,0:29:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到的只是一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}there stands only a child before me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.90,0:29:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在玩成人的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing at the games of men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.03,0:30:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为罗马的荣耀浴血奋战过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has fought and bled for the glory of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.43,0:30:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为他的统帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}For his Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.42,0:30:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道他不配作为你的部下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he not deserve to be treated{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.43,0:30:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,受到同等的对待吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}as any other beneath your command?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.16,0:30:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你们的困境表示同情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I stand sympathetic toward your plight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.84,0:30:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人数超出了预料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our numbers have unexpectedly swelled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.45,0:30:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能提供力所能及的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men and I can only provide what we ourselves can lay hand upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.73,0:30:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.80,0:30:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有多余的嘴巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps it would be, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.46,0:30:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃那些粮食的话 应该是够的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if resources were not drained by undeserving mouths…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.36,0:30:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stray from subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.80,0:30:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你不理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you from reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.02,0:30:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为罗马人也会对你们一样心慈手软吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think they would treat your people with such kindness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.33,0:30:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.92,0:30:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会效仿他们惨无人道的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor shall we become them by acts of unnecessary cruelty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.79,0:30:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可理喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fucking man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.03,0:30:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我便尽我所能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will provide you with what I can{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.98,0:31:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂饱你的慈悲心肠\N{\fnArial\fs30}to feed the lofty ideals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.37,0:31:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但恐怕达不到你的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet fear, it shall fall short of desired mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.32,0:31:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要改变计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see target adjusted, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.79,0:31:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,制定更确切的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}and center struck with surer purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.84,0:31:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想修改合约条款\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wish to alter terms of our agreement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.05,0:31:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想加点内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would but add to it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.54,0:31:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的船装满更有赚头的货物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see your ships filled with more promising cargo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.40,0:31:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳美特斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemetes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.58,0:31:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有话跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.53,0:31:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,先让我他妈的干掉这杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would finish fucking drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.70,0:31:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking Gauls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.03,0:31:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟色雷斯人一样操蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shitholes rivaling the Thracians…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.84,0:31:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是你养的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not fucking cur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.27,0:31:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gauls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.77,0:31:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚回去继续喝酒玩女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to drink and whores, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.62,0:31:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就从这个世界消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}or part from this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.04,0:31:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们自己选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.61,0:32:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用搞这么粗暴吧 给谁看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not need to be so rough in demonstration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.46,0:32:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要尽自己的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both must play our part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.35,0:32:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说你有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now speak about what have you discovered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.93,0:32:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人不爱罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man holds no love for Rome, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.75,0:32:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听他的言论就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}through weight of his words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.32,0:32:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他说的是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you balance them against truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.08,0:32:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他的忠诚和我没两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe his loyalties mirror my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.26,0:32:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还要最后考验一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I will set final test, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.48,0:32:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他言行是否一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gauge action against words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.36,0:32:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他说的是谎话 那人必有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}If words prove false, so does the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.23,0:32:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,查清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}See it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.73,0:32:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,自个儿兄弟都这么粗暴啊 是常有的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A common thing, to be so rudely handled by a brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.41,0:32:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, he stands no brother to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.54,0:33:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有赢得我信任的人都不是我兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor any man that has not earned my trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.60,0:33:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就怕破坏了好兴致\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear mood has taken sour turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.46,0:33:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.68,0:33:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们喝酒高兴高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us sweeten it with drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.91,0:33:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看还是拿更有意思的东西高兴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would set desire towards greater spoils.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.84,0:33:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边高兴 一边瞧瞧你的真面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the revealing of them, set true nature to light…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.98,0:33:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This precious jewel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.65,0:33:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾是城里很多奴隶的女主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}once stood domina to many slaves within the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.53,0:33:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们满足她的一切需求\N{\fnArial\fs30}They attended her every need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.07,0:33:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在反过来满足我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As she now attends ours…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.49,0:33:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯允许这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus allows this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.03,0:33:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的 当然不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck the gods, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.55,0:33:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿我的钱去享受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helped himself to my fucking coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.84,0:33:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我的回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I returned favor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.77,0:34:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是玩弄他的小宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}with one of his little pets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.77,0:34:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明你不是这些人的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove yourself no friend to these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.00,0:34:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿这个罗马人爽一爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use this Roman for untold pleasures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.71,0:34:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你爽完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you have finished, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.24,0:34:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得在她身上划一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}leave fresh mark upon her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.31,0:34:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们经常这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}As we have so often done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.81,0:34:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.86,0:34:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别慌 不要害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm yourself, calm yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.13,0:34:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一样 也是罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand a Roman, as you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.90,0:35:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫盖乌斯•尤利乌斯•恺撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Gaius Julius Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.82,0:35:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我奉马科斯•克拉苏之命而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come in the name of Marcus Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.54,0:35:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的军团正在北方集结\N{\fnArial\fs30}His legions are gathering in the north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.99,0:35:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会攻下这座城\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall take this city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.98,0:35:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让所有蹂躏你的那些畜生万劫不复\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see all those who have done this to you suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.61,0:35:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.69,0:35:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏很快就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon Crassus will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.85,0:35:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.21,0:35:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.08,0:36:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.52,0:36:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲比娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fabia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.49,0:36:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲比娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fabia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.49,0:36:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会忘了你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know that it shall not be forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.92,0:36:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会饶恕折磨你的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor the men that set you upon this fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.20,0:36:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干了什么 你个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done, you mad fuck?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.29,0:36:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送她上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set her free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.27,0:37:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯保护的罗马人都该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I would all Romans yet held by Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.64,0:37:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是我们当中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You truly do stand one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.46,0:37:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.34,0:37:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us see it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.79,0:37:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么比战火淬炼的兄弟情谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There stands no stronger bond between men, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.71,0:37:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,更为牢固\N{\fnArial\fs30}than one forged in war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.05,0:37:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor greater glory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.58,0:37:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,比为保卫祖国罗马而牺牲更为光彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}than to fall in defense of mother Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.91,0:37:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们每个人都曾宣誓效忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each of you swore sacramentum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.47,0:37:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}To obey order given.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.21,0:37:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不偷窃 不犯法\N{\fnArial\fs30}To refrain from theft or breach of common law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.15,0:37:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵守军规军纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect the Legionary Standard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.68,0:37:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不溃散 永不脱逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And never to break rank nor flee from enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.47,0:38:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而站在我面前的这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who stand before me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.75,0:38:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在战场上临阵脱逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}turned from field of battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.50,0:38:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对逆贼斯巴达克斯及其奴隶走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retreated from the rebel Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.15,0:38:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只顾抱头逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his army of slaves, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.05,0:38:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,畏惧敌人更甚于畏惧自己的将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}fearing them more than their own commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.82,0:38:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}An error{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.15,0:38:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚必须纠正过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}this night I shall see corrected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.84,0:38:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,经此教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the lesson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.41,0:38:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你们应该畏惧的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}lay fear upon proper name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.19,0:38:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.46,0:38:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱基尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.30,0:38:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.12,0:38:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡在十一抽杀律中幸存的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who survive decimation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.65,0:39:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,将被放逐到侍从营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall be banished to the followers camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.82,0:39:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,与奴隶和妓女为伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}To live among slaves and whores{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.62,0:39:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到某天 我认为可以恢复你们的地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}until such a day I deem you worthy of proper company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.53,0:39:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 我有话想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, I would have word…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.16,0:39:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不是你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not your father in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.74,0:39:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的统帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your fucking imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.25,0:39:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再拿你当孩子看待了 提比略\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have too long considered you a child, Tiberius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.59,0:39:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.91,0:39:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是个战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand a soldier now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.84,0:39:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该与其他战士受到同样的对待\N{\fnArial\fs30}and deserve to be treated as any other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.64,0:39:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他们站到一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join your men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.69,0:39:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall to command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.79,0:39:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽签\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draw lots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.73,0:40:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远不会忘记今夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let this night be forever remembered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.77,0:40:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,耻辱永远不要重现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And cause never repeated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.43,0:40:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你们是何命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Present your fates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.99,0:40:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.60,0:40:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot do that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.67,0:41:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉只有这么点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies there is so little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.48,0:41:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物严重不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food grows scarce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.61,0:41:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我们冒生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You risk life for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.44,0:41:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能有更多要求了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no more we can ask of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.82,0:41:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你们一个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}See heart lifted with welcomed news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.89,0:41:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏带领的军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus and his legions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.14,0:41:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离我们只有一天的行军路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}are but a day's march from our city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.84,0:41:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会夺回这座城\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will retake it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.10,0:41:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束我们受苦受难的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in the act end our suffering…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.64,0:41:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只怕你的苦难才刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear it has just begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.74,0:41:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 莱塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, Laeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.84,0:41:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须把我知道的告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to tell them what I saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.84,0:41:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,错在我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fault is my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.95,0:41:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然相信一个造反的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}For laying trust in a rebellious slave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.94,0:41:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.31,0:41:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.90,0:41:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃提斯就是帮他逃出来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the one Attius helped free?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.47,0:41:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个铁匠不知道这件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blacksmith held no knowledge of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.96,0:41:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友死了 就因为她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend dead, because of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.71,0:41:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们绑起来 带到斯巴达克斯那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}See them bound and taken to Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.83,0:42:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给他来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are his concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.76,0:42:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.70,0:42:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗雪埃提斯的冤情\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see memory of Attius well fucking honored!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.75,0:42:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有可疑的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}None give rise to suspicion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.64,0:42:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都渴望罗马人的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are eager for Roman blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.84,0:42:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,与真心加入我们的人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As any true to our cause should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.10,0:42:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲比娅 菲比娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fabia…Fabia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.95,0:42:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳美特斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemetes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.48,0:42:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说 你抱的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break fucking words, and knowledge of what you carry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.35,0:42:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个失踪的罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the missing Romans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.20,0:42:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从暗处冲出来攻击我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She came at me out of the shadows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.91,0:42:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,半死不活还想逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}half dead from attempted escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.94,0:42:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏有莱西克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it had not been for Lyciscus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.46,0:42:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不杀他们 他们就是这样感恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spare their lives, and this is fucking gratitude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.80,0:42:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck the Romans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.81,0:42:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,宰掉罗马混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck the Roman cunts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.13,0:42:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the fucking Romans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.81,0:42:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,操他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.94,0:43:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有罗马人都该被干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All should be struck from this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.60,0:43:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗马人去死 - 就像你干掉埃提斯一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck the Romans! - As you struck Attius from it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.45,0:43:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件事已经过去了 甘尼克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject has been laid to rest, Gannicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.40,0:43:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相也一起埋没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with fucking truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.41,0:43:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮助囚犯逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He aided the prisoners in escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.74,0:43:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现后 他还想杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And made attempt on my life when I discovered…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.99,0:43:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是市政官的妻子放了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Aedile's wife saw them free!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.18,0:43:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you come upon this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.48,0:43:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱塔把他们藏在她丈夫的马厩底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laeta hid them beneath the floor of her husband's stables.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.66,0:43:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨克莎把他们带到斯巴达克斯那里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saxa carries her and the others to Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.77,0:43:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It holds no matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.41,0:43:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃提斯是罗马人 他就是活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attius was a Roman, who fell to deserved fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.57,0:43:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我朋友 你个疯婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my friend, you mad bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.05,0:43:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seize tongue, brother…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.14,0:43:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,揍他 甘尼克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him, Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.16,0:43:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 打死这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him, get the fucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.18,0:44:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看看你的本事 甘尼克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what you're made of, Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.93,0:44:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,上啊 揍他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, hit him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.20,0:44:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.70,0:44:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm yourself…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.17,0:44:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.14,0:44:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.36,0:44:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.65,0:45:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.89,0:45:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left me no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.92,0:45:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他保护罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He protects the Romans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.57,0:45:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那位伟大的首领也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As does our mighty fucking leader!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.07,0:45:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拼了命造反难道就是为了这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what we have risked all for in joining cause?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.85,0:45:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯有令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus gives command!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.14,0:45:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意赔上性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would give my life, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.85,0:45:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也要让敌人的热血溅到我脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}to feel enemy's blood hot upon cheek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.32,0:46:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的命是斯巴达克斯给的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We owe Spartacus our own lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.45,0:46:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这事情他做错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet he is wrong in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.26,0:46:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing known by all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.67,0:46:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了那些蹂躏过你的畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}For every unwanted touch placed upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.57,0:46:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了曾经戴过的项圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}For every chain around neck, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.73,0:46:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,背上承受的鞭笞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and every lash upon back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.49,0:46:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿罗马人的血来偿还\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Roman blood as payment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.23,0:46:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要真正占领这座城\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let us see this city truly ours!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.76,0:47:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.47,0:47:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shall do as commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.70,0:47:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是士兵的天职\N{\fnArial\fs30}As all soldiers must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.89,0:47:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it be done!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.39,0:47:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.46,0:47:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.97,0:49:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我学到教训了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lesson well learned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.72,0:49:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,统帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.79,0:50:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这想法是一天比一天疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each day brings new madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.51,0:50:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你就要让我从天上摘月亮下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next you will ask to join in wresting moon from fucking heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.12,0:50:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的要求没那么不着边际\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sets purpose towards more earthly goal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.39,0:50:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所说的事情 有可能办到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it lie within possibility, what I seek to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.12,0:50:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么梦都能成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}All dreams are possible…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.84,0:50:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你别从梦里醒过来就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is but effort and cost that keeps it from waking grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.14,0:50:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成了我这最后一个要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}See this last thing that I ask of you to its end, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.26,0:50:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证你的船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will fill your ship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.20,0:50:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,装满城里的所有财物\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all the riches this city yet holds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.64,0:50:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就成交了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us see it done then, brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.36,0:50:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.16,0:50:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯他们都疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus and the others have gone mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.18,0:50:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在杀罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're killing the Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.44,0:50:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好西利西亚人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep watch over the Cilicians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.79,0:50:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你很喜欢跟他们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to favor their fucking company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.19,0:51:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 快 - 走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move, quickly! - Come on, quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.84,0:51:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.84,0:51:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you must keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.94,0:51:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走不到宅子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not make it to the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.53,0:51:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,走不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.49,0:51:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是带给斯巴达克斯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These for Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.29,0:51:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡老娘的道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take from fucking path!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.80,0:51:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not see Gannicus among you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.11,0:51:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就用不着怕他的婊子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor cause to heed his bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.74,0:51:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不用怕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.59,0:51:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.59,0:51:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}More Romans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.20,0:51:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God please, hands off him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.25,0:51:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,市政官的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Aedile's wife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.73,0:52:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我恢复理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will regain sense!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.20,0:52:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or fall where you stand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.11,0:52:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去理智的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is you who has lost sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.86,0:52:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,市政官的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Aedile's wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.58,0:52:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是害你栽跟头的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has seen you tumble from perch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.02,0:52:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她帮着那群罗马混蛋逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is the one who helped these Roman shits slip bond!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.57,0:52:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谎话连篇 倒在你面前装得挺像\N{\fnArial\fs30}And smiled at you through fucking lies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.33,0:52:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing of truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.44,0:52:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃提斯没有参与其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attius held no part in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.82,0:53:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不该有那样的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor did he deserve the end that he met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.15,0:53:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我待你仁慈 你就这样回报我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is return for the mercy I grant you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.27,0:53:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.57,0:53:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀死了我丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You robbed me of my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.90,0:53:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手下在城里屠杀了成百上千的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people slaughtered thousands within my city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.68,0:53:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I now stand condemned, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.71,0:53:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,救了几个人 便罪无可恕了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}for trying to save but a handful from such cruelty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.87,0:53:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是从我们的罗马主人那里学到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learned at the hand of our Roman master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.11,0:53:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her life, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.55,0:53:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就能重归于好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the act let us become as one again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.53,0:53:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,理所应当\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.25,0:53:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我岂能跟我们的敌人一路货色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I will not see us become the very thing we fight against.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.42,0:53:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人在这件事情上质疑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are many who question your mind in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.69,0:54:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有疑虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I question mind as well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.55,0:54:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何信任你 让你肩担重任\N{\fnArial\fs30}placing faith in you as a leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.75,0:54:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把幸存的罗马人带到我的宅子里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the Romans that yet live gathered within my villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.23,0:54:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,再有人胆敢违抗我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make further attempt against my will…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.11,0:54:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟今晚你们杀掉的人一个下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}follow those you have struck down this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.83,0:54:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮了我们很多很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man has helped us more than anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.38,0:54:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如今我怀疑他走错了路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I now doubt path he travels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.28,0:54:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是时候 走我们自己的路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then perhaps the time has come, to forge our own.{\r}
